"Admin and schedule list polish for the Waldorf community task manager (Hungarian UI), on branch feature/admin-list-polish. Five findings. (1) Clearing the filters does not clear the fields: on the teacher schedule Szűrők törlése and on the admin lists (Nyilvántartások, Feladatok és események, Jóváhagyások) the search, status, group and date fields keep values or fall back to defaults; the clear action must reset the fields and results to the unfiltered state; admin lists need a visible Szűrők törlése too if they lack one; state in the requirements what cleared means for the teacher group and date defaults. (2) Labels Keresés and Állapot (and Csoport, Kezdő dátum, Záró dátum on the teacher schedule) are not aligned with their inputs: align consistently at desktop and 320 px. (3) Új rekord is a plain link and must be a proper button; rename Rekord to Elem in user-facing copy (Új elem, Elem típusa, Elem létrehozása, Elem részletei, back links, user guide); identifiers and test ids stay. (4) Feature request: add symbols next to Jóváhagyva, Elutasítva, Függőben (check, cross, clock) in lists, detail pages and the status filter where sensible; the word stays, the icon is aria-hidden, WCAG contrast kept; also Aktív, Archivált, Nyitott, Ütemezve get a fitting symbol or none consistently. (5) Új feladat vagy esemény must also be a proper button. Keep the design, accessibility, responsive layout, update tests including Playwright checks and the user guide."
